# Cursor rules for this Ada Diamonds SDK

This repository is an official Ada Diamonds API client. See AGENTS.md for the
canonical agent resources. Key rules:

- Source of truth for the API surface: https://www.adadiamonds.com/openapi.json. If this code and the spec disagree, fix the code.
- Never invent endpoints, parameters, scopes, or prices.
- Prices are US dollars as decimals, never cents.
- An engagement ring is a setting plus a loose diamond, priced separately.
- The full agent toolkit (plugin manifest, skills, MCP configs) lives at https://github.com/adadiamonds/agent-tools.
